      "prompt": "A number is multiplied by 4, then 12 is subtracted, then the result is divided by 8. The answer is 7. What was the number?",
      "answer": 17,
      "hints": [
        "Work backwards from 7.",
        "Undo dividing by 8 first.",
        "7 × 8 = 56. Now undo subtracting 12."
      ],
      "explanation": "Undo dividing by 8: 7 × 8 = 56. Undo subtracting 12: 56 + 12 = 68. Undo multiplying by 4: 68 ÷ 4 = 17.",
      "solution": [
        {
          "say": "Undo ÷ 8.",
          "show": "7 × 8 = 56"
        },
        {
          "say": "Undo - 12.",
          "show": "56 + 12 = 68"
        },
        {
          "say": "Undo × 4.",
          "show": "68 ÷ 4 = 17"
        },
        {
          "say": "Check.",
          "show": "17 × 4 = 68, 68 - 12 = 56, 56 ÷ 8 = 7"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "olympiad",
